   "en": "GiNVA"
  },
  "description": {
   "en": "Ribbontail, an idol hero whose only merit is her cuteness, dreams of one day being recognized for her abilities as a hero. Her new buddy is ZEX, a state-of-the-art and most powerful autonomous robot in history. Ribbontail is excited to be able to take credit with Zechs, who shows no sign of opening up to her, but then she gets caught up in an unexpected incident...?",
   "ja": "可愛いだけが取り柄の野心溢れるアイドル系ヒーロー、「リボンテール」の新しいバディとして現れたのは、最新鋭＆史上最強の自律型ロボット「ゼクス」。彼女と一緒なら大活躍できるはずとはしゃぐリボンテールだったが、思わぬ事件に巻き込まれ…？正義とは…？悪とは…？思惑渦巻きまくり！"
  },
